    echr:hasSourceParagraph "34-35"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "In the decision the Public Prosecutor identified D.P., J.K. and M. J. as the officers accused in the applicant’s complaint."@en,
        "On 17 January 1997 the Public Prosecutor issued a decision dismissing the applicant’s criminal complaint."@en .

